  messagePause: 1.5
  technicalMessages:
  - "You\u2019ve gotta be kidding me\u2026 that was my TV."
  - But why would they leave it out there? I should get it back before someone takes
    it.
  - "Looks like a few more of my things are missing too. Maybe they\u2019re scattered
    around the building as well."
